msgctxt "64"
msgid "Give us back our money!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Huh? Hold up, who are you again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "My friend and I gave you eight million yen for a trip to Istanbul!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Pardon? What is this \"trip to Istanbul\" you speak of?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Ugh, come on! Don't pretend like you don't know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Um, miss? We're a publishing company, not a travel agency..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"I think you're at the wrong office. I'm sorry, but I do have to ask you to "
"leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "You guys are total scam artists! I'm so calling the cops on you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Hold it, pumpkin. Do you have any idea who you're dealin' with here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"How's about we keep you holed up for a few days and put a little proper "
"respect into ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Ki... Ki..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Kiryu-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Hey! How the hell do you know this guy!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san is like, a friend of mine... But he's got nothing to do with my "
"money!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Now, give it back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Oh, uh, yes. Of course! I don't really have a choice, now, do I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Ahaha... ha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Man, you should've told me you were Kiryu-san's girl!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "I'll get that money ready for you right away. Is cash okay?"
msgstr ""

